{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GXG6gUL5M2TYpgNBXgmZr8","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 2025 OpenReview rating scale 1-10 overall score review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Workshop | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FWorkshop\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/iclr-statistics/iclr-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference Submissions | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/submissions?venue=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024/Conference\"}]\n\nThe search results reference CoRL 2024 and 2025 on OpenReview, but don't contain specific information about the rating scale or review form structure. Let me search more specifically for the review form details.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Default Review Form | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://docs.openreview.net/reference/default-forms/default-review-form\"},{\"title\":\"Why are the \\\"rating\\\" and \\\"confidence\\\" fields in my PC Console wrong? | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://docs.openreview.net/getting-started/frequently-asked-questions/why-are-the-rating-and-confidence-fields-in-my-pc-console-wrong\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Reference-Free Rating of LLM Responses via Latent Information | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=WoYvrulVOp\"},{\"title\":\"Review Stage | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://docs.openreview.net/reference/stages/review-stage\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - shaohua0116/ICLR2019-OpenReviewData: Script that crawls meta data from ICLR OpenReview webpage. Tutorials on installing and using Selenium and ChromeDriver on Ubuntu.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/shaohua0116/ICLR2019-OpenReviewData\"},{\"title\":\"Review Form\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2022/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR2020 Open Review Explorer\",\"url\":\"https://horace.io/OpenReviewExplorer/\"},{\"title\":\"REFERENCE-FREE RATING OF LLM RESPONSES VIA ...\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/pdf/7abd65724a350c731a52b0e5cf304772b9b3289d.pdf\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the OpenReview default review form rating scale. \n\nThe OpenReview default review form uses a 1-10 rating scale with the following options: 10 (Top 5% of accepted papers, seminal paper), 9 (Top 15% of accepted papers, strong accept), 8 (Top 50% of accepted papers, clear accept), 7 (Good paper, accept), 6 (Marginally above acceptance threshold), 5 (Marginally below acceptance threshold), and ratings 4-1 for lower quality assessments.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain specific information about whether CoRL 2024 or 2025 uses this exact default form or has customized their review form. CoRL conferences on OpenReview may use this standard form or a modified version of it, but I couldn't find the specific CoRL review form configuration in the search results. For the most current information about CoRL's specific review form for 2024 or 2025, you would need to visit the CoRL OpenReview page directly or contact the conference organizers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c62bef3-f4e7-4ad6-8c63-7057bfddfd08","uuid":"019f7891-ee3e-4cd4-8acb-cb814db2a750","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:05:48.181Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 2025 OpenReview rating scale 1-10 overall score review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_019vRU8SnZUJ12KgMpsaBRQc","content":[{"title":"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/"},{"title":"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Workshop | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FWorkshop"},{"title":"ICLR 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/iclr-statistics/iclr-2024-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Conference Submissions | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/submissions?venue=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024/Confer