{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DrbUtS5C35iH3pSm9WE6G8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review report submitted.\n\n**Result: 5/10 — Borderline Reject**\n\nThe paper has a well-identified gap and strong ablation design (none < scalar < per-DOF gradient is convincing), but critical deficiencies prevent acceptance:\n\n1. **Fatal**: 5-entry bibliography (text discusses 10+ methods without citations)\n2. **Major**: No head-to-head comparison with A2C2/ReconVLA; no statistical reporting (CIs/seeds); single VLA+benchmark; \"orthogonal gains\" tested on SRPO only\n3. **Moderate**: No K sensitivity analysis; CRM augmentation confound; COC novelty overstated; 45D arithmetic inconsistency\n\n**Path to accept**: Fix bibliography, add external baselines, report mean±std across ≥3 seeds, test on a second VLA, add K ablation, and include the planned figures. The core empirical contribution (per-DOF conformal features are surprisingly informative for dimension-selective correction) is real and valuable."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4638,"cache_read_input_tokens":66964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4638},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c62bef3-f4e7-4ad6-8c63-7057bfddfd08","uuid":"fdb802b7-4179-44f0-82e0-032ada445297"}
